    <div class="research-note">
      <h4>A note on AI and evidence</h4>
      <p>AI tools can accelerate the mechanical parts of research — transcription, organization, drafting — but they cannot verify a fact, weigh conflicting evidence, or replace a primary source. Every conclusion on this site rests on documents I've examined and evaluated myself, following Evidence Explained citation standards. AI is a research assistant here, never a source.</p>
